          },
          "description": "Join Pippa the Garden Fairy on a magical journey to restore color to a once-vibrant garden! In this interactive audio adventure, children giggle, make silly sounds, and move their bodies to help bring plants and creatures back to life. As they participate, sleepy sunflowers bloom, shy bluebells appear, and butterflies take flight—all through the power of their own voices and movements. Perfect for ages 2-6, this enchanting story transforms listening time into an immersive, playful experience.",
